<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tamsa cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tamsa cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Kleinwort Benson said on Tuesday it had cut its rating for Mexico's Tubos de Acero de Mexico SA, or Tamsa, to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Stephen Hughes wrote in a report, &quot;After a meteoric 600 percent share price rise in the last two years, driven by the delivery of impressive earnings and margin growth consistently in excess of expectations, forecast operational performance is unlikely to evoke the same fervor.</p>
<p>-- &quot;With the strong Q4 '96 already discounted, we downgrade to hold.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts opened unchanged at 16-1/4 in New York.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
